# Region groups for the scenes (Docs/Design/30-towns-and-talk.md; the world of Docs/Design/60): a scene may name a
# group instead of its towns. Read before every other file.
#
# Ridgemere is the only city: the rain city on its hills above Ridgemere Sound, in the north-west. The six towns:
# Frosthollow (mining, a high snowy valley in the Whitefangs), Coldwater (on Glasswater, under the mountains, where the
# Long River rises), Oakhaven (the Warmwood), Mirebridge (the Sallow Fens, by the Long River), Larkfield (market town
# of the Larkdowns), Southmeadow (grain fields and orchards in the far south).

group cities = ridgemere
group rain_coast = ridgemere
group towns = frosthollow coldwater oakhaven mirebridge larkfield southmeadow
group north = ridgemere frosthollow coldwater
group south = oakhaven mirebridge larkfield southmeadow
group mountains = frosthollow coldwater
group lake = coldwater
group fens = mirebridge
group woods = oakhaven
group downs = larkfield southmeadow
group farmland = larkfield southmeadow
group warm = oakhaven mirebridge
group countryside = oakhaven mirebridge larkfield southmeadow
